{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrimmVeil is a dark fantasy adventure that pulls you into a single, relentless story. In this immersive multiplayer experience, you and your allies must face the twisted experiments of the malevolent scientist, Orion Grimm. Explore haunting environments, complete story-driven quests, and battle waves of deadly enemies \u2014 all leading toward a single, inevitable fate. No branching paths, no alternate endings \u2014 just one unforgettable journey through the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Co-op</strong> \u2013 Join forces with friends to survive together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Quests</strong> \u2013 Progress through a continuous, linear narrative filled with challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Survival</strong> \u2013 Fight against powerful enemies with melee attacks and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover haunted locations and hidden areas as you push deeper into the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Selection</strong> \u2013 Choose from multiple playable characters, each with unique animations.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948070?t=1770762286","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948070?t=1770762286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948070/19699ab9f719e5fedc0a571ff26b9a2c1365b0a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770762286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948070/19699ab9f719e5fedc0a571ff26b9a2c1365b0a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770762286","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"descri